~C. How to write history books.#History supports Argument A but is not the topic. Recheck the passage, context, or task wording and choose the option that preserves meaning and matches the standard.
~D. Whether boards are made of wood.#Unsupported as the shared issue. Recheck the passage, context, or task wording and choose the option that preserves meaning and matches the standard.
}

